# Testing

- Prefer behavior-focused Pest feature tests over assertions on private structure.
- Do not delete or weaken an existing test. Add coverage for a behavior change.
- `tests/Arch/NamingArchitectureTest.php` stays green.
- No real network and no real CLI run: fake HTTP and `Process`.
- Quality gate before a pull request: `composer test`, then `npm run lint`, `npm run types` and `npm run build`.
